cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "AEGIS-MHD: GPU MHD solver platform and the magnetic sieve study"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shaltout
    given-names: Abdelrahman
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Semedo2002/MagSieve-3D"
url: "https://github.com/Semedo2002/MagSieve-3D"
date-released: 2026-10-20
abstract: >-
  GPU finite-volume MHD solver (HLLD Riemann solver in CUDA via CuPy, MUSCL, SSP-RK3, GLM divergence
  cleaning, exact energy budget) in 2D and 3D, with the parameter study of striped magnetic fields and
  the Richtmyer-Meshkov instability, and a high-Mach magnetized RMI benchmark.
keywords:
  - magnetohydrodynamics
  - Richtmyer-Meshkov instability
  - HLLD
  - CUDA
  - shock physics
